## C1001 -- a comptime expression that overflows int.
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; C1001_comptime_overflow.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: keep comptime arithmetic inside int, or use +% for arithmetic that wraps
fn big() = comptime(9223372036854775807 + 1)
print big()
